# かな入力練習 (design 11.14), for tools/ui_run.py: the template opened, keys held
# shown on the keyboard, a practice begun and keys judged plain and shifted,
# the split keyboard, 薙刀式, the Dvorak translation and back, 先読みキー数
# asked in its panel, ローマ字, and closed. The menu opens with the item last
# chosen under the pointer, so its rows move as the steps go.
open 019c403c-bb89-7133-acc4-ddd109fb8182
expect kanatype: ready
wait 800
win かな入力練習
click 500 690
keydown 0D
keydown 09
wait 300
shot kana_held
keyup 0D
keyup 09
key 28
expect kanatype: started
wait 300
shot kana_started
key 14
expect kanatype: key KeyQ wrong ら
keydown E1 02
key 14 02
keyup E1
expect kanatype: key KeyQ wrong ひ
wait 50
shot kana_wrong
key 29
expect kanatype: stopped
